OBJECTIVE, second sentence ("When it no longer receives BPDUs, it sets the port to the forwarding state."):
  not a step of the case, and NOT exercised: on a direct lead, stopping port1.0.6's BPDUs means either taking the
  link down (port1.0.7 goes down with it) or filtering BPDUs on port1.0.6, which would open a real loop. Recorded as
  not measured, not graded.

